<title>UK: Phibro keeps single Brent turning physical.</title>
<headline>Phibro keeps single Brent turning physical.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The single Brent cargo turning physical on Thursday was kept by Phibro ahead of the five o'clock deadline, traders said.</p>
<p>The cargo is due to load May 16-18.</p>
<p>-London newsroom, +44 171 542 8145</p>
